      en: ["The reserve was officially established on December 1, 1976, by a government decree.", "It encompasses a total protected area of 49,800 hectares in central Turkmenistan.", "The territory supports 68 species of mammals and approximately 280 bird species.", "It serves as one of the primary habitats for the endangered Persian leopard.", "The flora consists of over 1,200 plant species, including wild walnut and grapevines.", "The reserve is strategically located in close proximity to the capital city, Ashgabat."],
